x02003;&#x02003;Alcohol</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">71.6</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">48.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12.53<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn10-ijerph-06-01026">***</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" colspan="4" rowspan="1"><hr/>Inclusion of cessation strategies<hr/></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Keep diaries of smoking</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">61.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">87.2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">24.16<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn10-ijerph-06-01026">***</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Practice refusing cigarette offers</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">83.8</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">92.7</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.22<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn8-ijerph-06-01026">*</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Sign a contract that has rewards for not smoking</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">35.6</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">58.2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">11.25<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn10-ijerph-06-01026">***</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Sign a contract that has penalties for smoking</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">13.5</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6.0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.34<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn8-ijerph-06-01026">*</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Invite a family member to participate</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">52.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">37.7</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.69<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn8-ijerph-06-01026">*</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Assess level of nicotine dependence</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">84.9</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">89.7</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.22</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Practice ways of coping with temptations</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">97.3</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">98.3</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.26</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Do any of aversive smoking</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.7</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.07</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Throw away all of smoking-related paraphernalia</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">67.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">69.6</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.16</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Practice meditation</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">87.8</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">90.5</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.44</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Change diet in any way</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">66.2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">72.7</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.14</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Increase physical activity</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">84.0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">90.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.08</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;Gradually reduce or taper smoking</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">83.8</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" col